## ⚡ Quick Start

1. **Download** the GTA 6 Launcher companion package.
2. **Extract** the archive to a folder on your Windows desktop.
3. **Run** the executable as Administrator to open the launcher companion.

The main dashboard brings together official platform destinations, setup guidance, account notes, and update information. It does not launch the console game directly from Windows.

## 🖥️ Requirements

| Component | Requirement |
|---|---|
| OS | Windows 10 / 11, 64-bit |
| RAM | 4 GB minimum |
| Storage | 500 MB available |
| Privileges | Administrator |

