## ❓ FAQ

**Do I need to run it as Administrator?**

Yes — admin rights are required for the overlay to attach.

**Can antivirus software flag the executable?**

Security software may flag unfamiliar executables. Review the file and its source before deciding whether to run it.

**Does it work on Windows 11?**

The desktop companion is intended for Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit systems.

**Can this launcher start GTA 6 directly on Windows?**

No. Grand Theft Auto VI is currently available for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. This companion organizes official platform links and setup information; it is not a native PC game launcher.

**How do I update GTA 6?**

Check for updates through the game library or download management screen on your PlayStation or Xbox console.

